codex_fact = "Oxycodone was synthesised in 1916 and marketed for decades as a safer alternative to morphine and heroin — the same claim that had been made for heroin itself when Bayer sold it as a cough remedy in 1898. The reason this one removes your fall damage is the actual mechanism: opioids do not repair the injury, they remove your knowledge of it."
